at":"2023-03-21T22:52:09Z","updated_at":"2024-02-20T08:59:47Z","closed_at":"2024-02-20T08:59:47Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"#### Problem Description\r\nWe can't remove a loaded script in running mitm-web.\r\nThe scripts option for executing a script with mitm-web seems to have a bug.\r\n\r\nNote: If we specify multiple scripts to be executed, then if we intend to remove them, one script remains present and cant be unloaded\r\n\r\n#### Steps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. In a running mitm-web instance, go to Options > Scripts > add path to script.\r\n2. Try removing, the script, it won't remove. It simply says \"no such script\" even when removing.\r\n3. Add more scripts. All can be removed except one.\r\n\r\nApplying script\r\n![chrome_Qy0rYZw6QZ](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/28684962/226761750-cc220b58-2b5d-4af1-a5a2-cb4da8478ae9.png)\r\n\r\nError: No such script, on removing it\r\n![chrome_tIZ1HoQ2Km](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/28684962/226761900-fccc9584-515f-4165-9530-bb3e68f934ca.png)\r\n\r\nShould be removed like this: no errors\r\n![chrome_4FAF27syxE](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/28684962/226761924-b72db2f3-2cdc-492c-8028-c633083975ae.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n#### System Information\r\nMitmproxy: 9.0.1 binary\r\nPython:    3.11.0\r\nOpenSSL:   OpenSSL 3.0.7 1 Nov 2022\r\nPlatform:  Windows-10-10.0.22621-SP0\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"mhils","id":1019198,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTkxOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1019198?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils","html_url":"https://github.com/mhils","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gith